WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.830
- I have to say one thing.

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.990
The biggest challenge for me
was, in all of our singing,

00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.810
Will and I for some
reason were face to face.

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:07.770
Like, they couldn't have us

00:00:07.770 --> 00:00:09.300
just facing different directions.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.380
We were face to face.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.540
You try singing for like
three weeks straight

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.622
while staring at Will
Ferrell, who's like...

00:00:15.622 --> 00:00:18.930
(audience applauding)

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:22.770
He's holding his ear for no
reason, and I would hit a note

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.781
and he'd look at me and go, "No."

00:00:24.781 --> 00:00:28.027
(audience laughs)

00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:28.860
"Again!"

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.590
- "Better! Better!"

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.423
- Yeah.

00:00:33.509 --> 00:00:35.190
So brutal!
- So funny!

00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:37.080
- You can actually hear
me laughing on the tracks,

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:37.913
I'm sure now.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:39.743
Holding it back.

00:00:39.743 --> 00:00:41.280
- You're all so wonderful in it,

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:44.070
and you pull it off and you
sound amazing and look amazing.

00:00:44.070 --> 00:00:46.808
It's very, yeah.
(audience cheering)

00:00:46.808 --> 00:00:47.641
The best!

